"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 4"
},
{
"url": "https://eleveny123.github.io/EvoCenter/assets/screenshots/5.jpg",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 5"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 8,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **iOS 18 Interface:** Faithfully recreates the latest connectivity layout, centralized management, and Control Center style.\n- **HomeKit Support:** Directly integrates smart home devices, displaying temperature and humidity and managing household devices quickly.\n- **Layout Customization:** Supports paging (horizontal or vertical swipe), a 5-column display option, and scaling the entire interface up or down.\n- **Icon Tinting:** Lets you customize icon colors for toggle-style modules to your liking.\n- **Extended Modules:** Supports combining Shortcuts into a single toggle and adding 8 transparent empty slots for creative, unique layouts.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
